start_offset":6608,"table_hint":null,"text":"How is the study designed?\n\n"},{"end_offset":6652,"heading":null,"page":5,"segment_id":"S000110","start_offset":6636,"table_hint":null,"text":"Design Details\n\n"},{"end_offset":6669,"heading":null,"page":5,"segment_id":"S000111","start_offset":6652,"table_hint":null,"text":"Primary Purpose\n\n"},{"end_offset":6688,"heading":null,"page":5,"segment_id":"S000112","start_offset":6669,"table_hint":null,"text":": Supportive Care\n\n"},{"end_offset":6700,"heading":null,"page":5,"segment_id":"S000113","start_offset":6688,"table_hint":null,"text":"Allocation\n\n"},{"end_offset":6714,"heading":null,"page":5,"segment_id":"S000114","start_offset":6700,"table_hint":null,"text":": Randomized\n\n"},{"end_offset":6736,"heading":null,"page":5,"segment_id":"S000115","start_offset":6714,"table_hint":null,"text":"Interventional Model\n\n"},{"end_offset":6759,"heading":null,"page":5,"segment_id":"S000116","start_offset":6736,"table_hint":null,"text":": Parallel Assignment\n\n"},{"end_offset":6768,"heading":null,"page":5,"segment_id":"S000117","start_offset":6759,"table_hint":null,"text":"Masking\n\n"},{"end_offset":6793,"heading":null,"page":5,"segment_id":"S000118","start_offset":6768,"table_hint":null,"text":": Single (Investigator)\n\n"},{"end_offset":6811,"heading":null,"page":6,"segment_id":"S000119","start_offset":6793,"table_hint":null,"text":"[DOCLING_PAGE 6]\n\n"},{"end_offset":6835,"heading":null,"page":6,"segment_id":"S000120","start_offset":6811,"table_hint":null,"text":"Arms and Interventions\n\n"},{"end_offset":7275,"heading":null,"page":6,"segment_id":"S000121","start_offset":6835,"table_hint":"TABLE","text":"[DOCLING_TABLE rows=3 columns=2]\n| Participant Group/Arm | Intervention/Treatment |\n| No Intervention: Fasting Group Clear fluids up to the time of the procedure and no food for at least 2 hours before the procedure. |  |\n| Experimental: Non fasting group Clear fluids and food up to the time of the procedure. | Other: Non fasting Non fasting group is allowed for clear fluids and food up to the time of the procedure. |\n[/DOCLING_TABLE]\n\n"},{"end_offset":7305,"heading":null,"page":6,"segment_id":"S000122","start_offset":7275,"table_hint":null,"text":"What is the study measuring?\n\n"},{"end_offset":7331,"heading":null,"page":6,"segment_id":"S000123","start_offset":7305,"table_hint":null,"text":"Primary Outcome Measures\n\n"},{"end_offset":7695,"heading":null,"page":6,"segment_id":"S000124","start_offset":7331,"table_hint":"TABLE","text":"[DOCLING_TABLE rows=2 columns=3]\n| Outcome Measure | Measure Description | Time Frame |\n| Composite incidence of nausea, vomiting, abdominal pain, emergency intubation and aspiration | The incidence of any of nausea, vomiting, abdominal pain aspiration or emergency intubation during the procedure and up to 8 hours will be recorded. | 8 hours |\n[/DOCLING_TABLE]\n\n"},{"end_offset":7723,"heading":null,"page":6,"segment_id":"S000125","start_offset":7695,"table_hint":null,"text":"Secondary Outcome Measures\n\n"},{"end_offset":7741,"heading":null,"page":7,"segment_id":"S000126","start_offset":7723,"table_hint":null,"text":"[DOCLING_PAGE 7]\n\n"},{"end_offset":8762,"heading":null,"page":7,"segment_id":"S000127","start_offset":7741,"table_hint":"TABLE","text":"[DOCLING_TABLE rows=5 columns=3]\n| Outcome Measure | Measure Description | Time Frame |\n| Incidence of hypoglycaemia | Drop of Blood sugar < 3.6 mmol/l as assessed by finger prick test before the procedure. | 1 hour |\n| Incidence of hypotension | Drop of SBP<90 mmHg and /or DBP<60 mmHg as measured by manual sphygmomanometer before the procedure. | 1 hour |\n| Patient satisfaction | A questionnaire given to the patient after the procedure to assess their experience , symptoms and overall satisfaction with regard to the procedure. The questionnaire include a preset of yes/no question including feeling hungry, thirsty or lethargic before the procedure, feeling headache, nausea or vomited during or up to 1 hour after the procedure. then a final overall satisfaction score about the procedure today from 1- 5, with 1 being not satisfied and 5 being extremely satisfied. | 1 hour |\n| chest infection | All patients will be contacted or reviewed in clinic to assess for chest infection | At 30 days |\n[/DOCLING_TABLE]\n\n"},{"end_offset":8795,"heading":null,"page":7,"segment_id":"S000128","start_offset":8762,"table_hint":null,"text":"Collaborators and Investigators\n\n"},{"end_offset":8875,"heading":null,"page":7,"segment_id":"S000129","start_offset":8795,"table_hint":null,"text":"This is where you will find people and organizations involved with this study.\n\n"},{"end_offset":8884,"heading":null,"page":7,"segment_id":"S000130","start_offset":8875,"table_hint":null,"text":"Sponsor\n\n"},{"end_offset":8913,"heading":null,"page":7,"segment_id":"S000131","start_offset":8884,"table_hint":null,"text":"Blackpool Victoria Hospital\n\n"},{"end_offset":8928,"heading":null,"page":7,"segment_id":"S000132","start_offset":8913,"table_hint":null,"text":"Investigators\n\n"},{"end_offset":8946,"heading":null,"page":8,"segment_id":"S000133","start_offset":8928,"table_hint":null,"text":"[DOCLING_PAGE 8]\n\n"},{"end_offset":9027,"heading":null,"page":8,"segment_id":"S000134","start_offset":8946,"table_hint":null,"text":"Principal Investigator: Hesham abdelaziz, Ph.D, Blackpool Victoria Hospital -UK\n\n"},{"end_offset":9041,"heading":null,"page":8,"segment_id":"S000135","start_offset":9027,"table_hint":null,"text":"Publications\n\n"},{"end_offset":9050,"heading":null,"page":8,"segment_id":"S000136","start_offset":9041,"table_hint":null,"text":"General\n\n"},{"end_offset":9196,"heading":null,"page":8,"segment_id":"S000137","start_offset":9050,"table_hint":null,"text":"These publications are provided voluntarily by the person who enters information about the study and may be about anything related to the study.\n\n"},{"end_offset":9522,"heading":null,"page":8,"segment_id":"S000138